 "description": "Get the detailed response for a specific product ID. Use this after discover_products or find_similar_products when you need merchant description, store info, all images, SKU-level availability variants, SKU, colorKey/size matrix, exact variant prices/compareAtPrice in the requested currency, and the direct link to purchase.",
